## Confirmed safe paths (7 October 2026)

- Relative include selection preserves shared-folder boundaries: projectWorkspace.js normalizes include with safeRelativePath, pathIsSelected matches exact path or descendants, AssetsService scanSource honors it. Selecting a.jpg and b.md does not authorize the whole parent. (7 October 2026)
